>> title: Cranberry Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: cranberry, orange, thanksgiving, turkey, stovetop
>> servings: 8
>> time: 25 min
>> step.1: dissolve
>> step.2: steep 5 min
>> step.3: simmer 12 min
>> step.4: season, then cool

Dissolve @sugar{1%cup}(200 g) in @water{3/4%cup}(180 mL) and @fresh orange juice{1/4%cup}(60 mL) over medium heat.

Steep @cinnamon stick{1} and @orange zest{2%tsp} in @&(~1)syrup{} for ~{5%min}.

Simmer @fresh cranberries{12%oz}(340 g) in @&(~1)spiced syrup{} for ~{12%min}, until most of the berries have burst.

Season @&(~1)sauce{} with @kosher salt{1/8%tsp} and @fresh lemon juice{1%tsp}, then cool to room temperature.
